      "title": "File:Enterprise lowered into test stand.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/Enterprise_lowered_into_test_stand.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Enterprise_lowered_into_test_stand.jpg",
      "width": 4480,
